  "ingredients": [
    "0.66666668653488 cup white sugar",
    "5 large egg yolks",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "2 cups heavy cream",
    "1 cup whole milk",
    "2.5 teaspoons pure vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DB0LdLsOVBnYJe4j35rKhzyr8Yk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-005-step-01-6e8b81c451354d49ab4783c6918f68ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sugar, egg yolks, and salt together in a large bowl until mixture becomes fluffy and changes from dark golden to pale yellow.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Mvr8vmph_vV1qViF3O89eYqFbWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-006-step-02-f46d1495fb764cd8991dc886319be7ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat cream and milk in a heavy saucepan over medium heat, stirring occasionally to prevent sticking to the bottom. Cook until mixture just starts to simmer and little bubbles begin to appear on the surface, 5 to 8 minutes. Remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hzgnOL55iQB_11FbhQ7UuY_BL9c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-007-step-03-4c84f5cd4e244d7e8d015e92dc3f62f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk a ladleful of hot cream mixture into egg yolk mixture. Add another ladleful and whisk thoroughly before adding the next (this will keep the eggs from cooking). Gradually add remaining cream mixture and whisk thoroughly. Whisk in vanilla, then let cool completely, 30 to 45 minutes. You can place the bowl in a larger bowl filled with ice water to cool it faster.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ag81N8y6Zz-y8D-0PxFG75syUto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-008-step-04-1e355c8d06b742b8a14f8fa2df7d98b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cooled mixture into a pitcher, cover, and refrigerate until ice cold, 4 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MS_p4gTQW6ixHxHLGayApT0X08o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-009-step-05-c50946dcb7b741239ce463ea26c069c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cold custard mixture into an ice cream maker and process according to the manufacturer's instructions until it reaches the consistency of soft ice cream, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cIaiGekIYSXNsgv6VJuL3VmWvb0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-010-step-06-82e04d49442e489382f771e4d6385491.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quickly transfer to a plastic container and place a piece of plastic wrap over the surface of the custard. Cover the container and freeze until firm enough to scoop, at least 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wrQe6DKtOEPtHYFG5R8IZVy5xJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-011-step-07-2a6ea34b39c842d5b2d4fb6c39f4a053.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HbMKuTC9Lcp4LfvWKzJXg5DXQow=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/258370-frozen-vanilla-custard-VAT-001-Beauty-4x3-c49955e1d3d841d7ac640654df4bbc86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/258370/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
